e before the fun can begin. This...\n\n### Tonieplay game card not recognised\n\nWe’re sorry to hear you’re having trouble with your Tonieplay game cards! Don’t worry - we’ll help you get back on track. Sometimes a simple restart solves the issue: Make sure your Toniebox 2 is on and unplugged. Squeeze both ears until the Toniebox enters the sleep light with timer setting. Keep s...\n\n### How long does the Toniebox 2 remember your auto-saved status when you remove the disc, take a break or play something else?\n\nIf you remove your Tonieplay disc for a break or to play another Tonie product, the progress will stop. This means that the game is not \"paused\" anymore, but you will load it up from scratch again. However, each game acts a little differently. For example the quiz games will not continue a running r...\n\n### Can you ever choose the chapter?\n\nThat highly depends on the games, but in most cases: no. The only game that lets you choose which story to play is Winnie The Pooh.\n\n### Can I restart a Tonieplay game?\n\nNeed to go back a bit in your game? Easy! Simply lift the Tonieplay Disc off your Toniebox 2, count to five (a little dramatic pause never hurt anyone ✨), and pop it back on. Your game will restart from the top, or depending on the Tonieplay game, will pick up at your most recent checkpoint, if you'...\n\n### What do I need in order to play a Tonieplay game?\n\nTo play a Tonieplay Game you’ll need a Toniebox 2 and a Tonieplay Controller. If it’s the first time the game is being played you’ll also need a WiFi connection, but after this it will work offline too.\n\n### What aged children is Tonieplay suitable for?\n\nThere are Tonieplay games for everyone from 3 years and up, with even more coming soon...\n\n### Is Tonieplay compatible with Toniebox 1?\n\nNo, due to the technological advancements of Tonieplay, it’s only compatible with our newest model, the Toniebox 2.\n\n### Are Tonieplay games multiplayer?\n\nGreat question! Yes! Although our Tonieplay Games are designed for solo play, they can all also be enjoyed together with friends or family.\n\n### How much help will my child need with playing a Tonieplay game?\n\nJust like with classic board games, we recommend parents join in for the first few rounds to help kids get started. Tonieplay Games are designed to be easy to follow, but we’ve also included a written manual in every box for those who prefer to read up first. Younger players may need a little suppor...\n\n### Can I skip past the intro to the Tonieplay game?\n\nYes! Most games include a skip feature so you can move forward or back through the story. Intros are usually skippable, but some moments – like answering a quiz question or making a choice in an interactive story – can’t be replayed right away.\n\n### How do Tonieplay games appear in the app?\n\nJust like with all our other Tonies, once you’ve put a Tonieplay Game on the Toniebox 2 you’ll be able to see it in the ‘Mine’ section of the app.\n\n### What new Tonieplay specific data will we capture?\n\nWhen you use the new function Tonieplay, usage and operation information about the in-game interaction with the Toniebox will be collected. We process the data (e.g. frequency of use of individual games, errors that resulted in termination of use) for the same purpose as we process all other Interac...--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nMeet the Toniebox 2: Features FAQ – tonies® Support (https://support.tonies.com/hc/en-ca/articles/29036389310738-Meet-the-Toniebox-2-Features-FAQ)\nciteturn780search2 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last week; Head to the tonies® app to set your desired time, the sleep light will then turn on and the Tonie placed on top of the Toniebox 2 will play until the timer runs out, before going to sleep too. ... Add the Tonieplay controller in the middle of the light ring and press the button to start.\n\n# Meet the Toniebox 2: Features FAQ\n\n# MEET THE TONIEBOX 2!\n\nImage: 1.gif\n\n#### Below we break down all the new features of Toniebox 2, just click and explore:\n\nFULL BATTERY DISPLAY\n\nThe Toniebox 2 is built to keep up with busy days, snoozy nights and hours of songs, stories and fun.\n\nWhen you plug in the USB-C Charging cable, the Dynamic Light Ring will visually show the battery level.\n\nImage: 2.png\n\nWant to check remotely? Simply head to the tonies® app while your Toniebox 2 is connected to Wi-Fi to view and monitor the current battery state.\n\nSLEEP TIMER WITH LIGHT\n\nThe Sleep Timer with Light lets you choose when the Toniebox powers down, gently fading out the sound and glow to help your little snoozer drift off peacefully.\n\nHead to the tonies® app to set your desired time, the sleep light will then turn on and the Tonie placed on top of the Toniebox 2 will play until the timer runs out, before going to sleep too.\n\nImage: 3.jpeg\n\nSUNRISE ALARM\n\nImage: 4.gif\n\nThe Sunrise Alarm eases them into the day with a gentle sunrise glow and wake-up tunes.\n\nSimply head to the tonies® app each night before bedtime and set your desired wakeup time for your little listener.\n\nDYNAMIC LIGHT RING\n\nThe Light Ring glows in rainbow colours when Tonies are playing, and gives helpful light cues to guide kids through the Tonieplay games.\n\nImage: 5.gif\n\nTONIEPLAY\n\nTonieplay unlocks new world of interactive games, stories, quizzes, challenges and more, exclusive to Toniebox 2. \n\nReady to play? Here’s how:\n1. Pick a Tonieplay game.\n2. Put it on top of the Toniebox - first play? The Tonieplay game will need to be downloaded before it can be play. This will typically take up to 30 minutes (depending on your internet speed). Note that our longer games, like Quizzles, will take the longest time to download.\n3. Add the Tonieplay controller in the middle of the light ring and press the button to start.\n4. Get ready to play! \n\nImage: 6.gif\n\nWORKS WITH ALL TONIES\n\nYou heard right! Every Tonie that has been released prior to launch of Toniebox 2 will work with the Toniebox 2, and all future Tonies will work with the Toniebox 1. \n\nPlease note: Tonieplay Games will not work with Toniebox 1.\n\nImage: 7.pngImage: 8.pngImage: 9.png\n\nCERTIFIED 1+\n\nThe Toniebox 2 is certified 1+ \n\nDesigned and tested to be safe, intuitive, and engaging for kids aged 1 and up.\n\nThe all new 1+ or 3+ mode can be set and changed via the app. To ensure you have control of the content that can be played on your Toniebox 2.\n\n3+ Age Mode: 🎵 Can play while charging.\n\n1+ Age Mode: ⚠️ Cannot play while charging and tilt to rewind or fast-forward is disabled.\n\nImage: 10.png\n\nUSB-C CHARGING \n\nPower up in no time – keep your Toniebox 2 fully charged and ready to play with fast and easy USB-C charging.\n\nYou can use the 1+ 20cm charging cable included with your Toniebox 2, or any other third party compatible USB-C charging cable. \n\nImage: 11.pngImage: 12.png\n\nNEW TONIES® APP CONTROLS\n\nWith the tonies® app, you can check the battery level, manage your Tonies collection and tweak settings right from your phone. \n\nAnd there's more to come – fresh features are being added all the time to allow you to co-pilot your little one's listening experience.\n\nImage: 13.png\n\nPLAYBACK CONTROLS\n\n👀 Live Playback Status: See exactly which Tonie is on the box and view the chapter currently playing, right from your screen.\n\n⏯️ Pause and Play: Halt the action for a quick snack break and jump right back in when you're ready.\n\n⏮️ Restart and Skip: Instantly rewind to a favourite song or skip ahead to the next chapter.\n\nStill have questions? Reach out to our Customer Happiness team and we can support you further: Click here to contact us--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nTonieplay – tonies® Support (https://support.tonies.com/hc/en-au/sections/29036400009490-Tonieplay)\nciteturn780search3 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 2 days ago; Tonieplay Games are desig